# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Parallel ATA — the array is SATA, which is AHCI, not PATA
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ATA_PIIX and ATA_GENERIC are kept: QEMU's default IDE controller is a PIIX,
# and ATA_GENERIC is the catch-all that keeps an unknown controller bootable.
# That is cheap insurance for the one machine we cannot predict — the VM.

